    "text": "![](https://volmarrsheathenism.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/file_00000000509461f4a3f2bf4126e64fd05012416764587936404.png?w=1024)\n\n⚡—Here’s a simple Viking-inspired sound ritual you can do while listening to Viking folk music at home with earbuds. It’s light, calming, and honors both Viking music and the spirits.",
    "position": 1
  },
