    "text": "* Sit comfortably where you usually relax (living room, temple room, or wherever feels right).\n* Light a single candle, if you wish, as a symbolic hearth-fire.",
    "position": 2
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "post_2025_08_20_f0_9f_8c_8c-ritual-of-sound-and-stillness_003",
