    "text": "* Put in your earbuds, and start to play Viking music.\n* Close your eyes.\n* Take nine deep breaths in through the nose, out through the mouth.\n* Imagine each exhale blowing away the noise of the day, leaving only calm.",
    "position": 3
  },
  {
