    "published": "2025-08-20T04:25:56+00:00",
    "text": "“Song of the skalds,  \nSpirit-wind stirs,  \nDrum-beats of dawn,  \nDreams now awaken.\n\nHail to the hall,  \nHearth-fire within,  \nMusic is memory,  \nMystery flows.”",
    "position": 4
  },
  {
