    "published": "2025-08-20T04:25:56+00:00",
    "text": "* In your mind, say:  \n  “I gift these sounds to the Aesir and Vanir, to the land-wights, and to my ancestors. May they flow as rivers of memory, may they rise as wind over sea.”\n* As the music plays, imagine it leaving your earbuds and weaving through the unseen world—an offering carried on the air.",
    "position": 5
